    !---------------------------------------------
    ! rocsolver_slauum
    !---------------------------------------------
    !> \brief The LAUUM functions compute the product of the upper (or lower) triangular part U (or
    !> L) of a
    !> symmetric/Hemitian matrix ``A`` with its transpose.
    !>
    !> \details
    !> If ``uplo`` indicates upper, then \f$U U^H\f$ is computed. If ``uplo`` indicates lower, then
    !> \f$L^H L\f$ is computed instead.
